        "§Purpose",
        "§F40 conclusion",
        "§Model layers"
      ]
    },
    "nonGoalSummary": {
      "text": "F40 does not delete DailyPlan[], change storage keys, change compatibility reads, or implement AI/planner rewrites; these are later features.",
      "sectionRefs": [
        "§Purpose",
        "§F40 conclusion",
        "§DailyPlan legacy boundary"
      ]
    }
  },
  "thesis": "PlanBundle is the core persistent planning aggregate; planner inputs are transient; execution history remains separate and immutable; legacy DailyPlan[] is only a compatibility boundary until a later breaking migration.",
